<title>PHILIPPINES: PCI Leasing says debt papers upgraded.</title>
<headline>PCI Leasing says debt papers upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCI Leasing and Finance Inc said on Wednesday the Credit Information Bureau Inc (CIBI) had upgraded the rating of its long-term commercial paper to CIB Aa from CIB A.</p>
<p>The rating is for PCI Leasing's four-year, 500-milion peso commercial paper.</p>
<p>CIB Aa is the second highest rating which denotes that the debt paper has a small degree of investment risk.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
